	'fp_s1_1' => 'We believe orthodontic pricing should be transparent and unambiguous. Your initial thirty-minute conversation is free. If you choose to proceed, the comprehensive records appointment costs €190, covering a 3D digital scan, two diagnostic X-rays, clinical photographs, and your included forty-minute plan presentation. Full teenage fixed braces courses start from €3,600.',
