	'fvp_lead' => 'Your first visit to Soroe Clinic is a calm thirty-minute conversation with no clinical pressure. We listen to your concerns, examine your teeth, and outline practical possibilities.',
	'fvp_s1_1' => 'Your first visit lasts thirty minutes and is completely free of charge. You will meet with Nadia Haddad and one of our orthodontists in our dedicated conversation room rather than a clinical chair. We listen carefully to what you wish to address, look closely at your teeth, and take several standard external facial and intraoral photographs.',
