	'fvp_s2_1' => 'We encourage you to bring anyone whose support or input you value. For teenagers under eighteen, a parent or legal guardian must attend so we can discuss medical history, scheduling preferences, and financial options together. Adult patients are warmly welcomed to attend on their own or bring a partner, parent, or friend.',
	'fvp_s2_2' => 'Having a second person present often helps when taking in clinical observations and discussing treatment timelines. Our conversation room has comfortable seating, providing a quiet setting where you can ask questions freely, look over sample models, and discuss daily routines without feeling rushed by clinical procedures.',
