	'hc_lead' => 'Orthodontic care at Soroe Clinic follows an orderly sequence of three visits before the first tray. We plan every phase in writing so you know exactly what to expect from the start.',
	'hc_s1_1' => 'Before active treatment begins, we complete three dedicated appointments to ensure thorough planning without pressure. First is the thirty-minute first conversation, which is completely free. We examine your teeth, listen to your concerns, and take preliminary photographs, with no X-rays taken and no decisions required that day. Next is the forty-five-minute records appointment, costing €190, where Aiyana Brooks takes a precise 3D scan, two digital X-rays, and diagnostic photographs.',
	'hc_s1_2' => 'Finally, you attend a forty-minute plan conversation, included in your diagnostic fee. Dr. Varga or Dr. Mensah presents your comprehensive written plan, explaining appliance options, estimated timeline, and exact fees for you to review at home.',
	'hc_s1_h' => 'What happens during the initial appointments before treatment?',
	'hc_s2_1' => 'Once you decide to proceed with your proposed plan, Sofia Marchetti schedules your first fitting appointment, which lasts sixty minutes. During this dedicated visit, your fixed braces are placed or your initial clear aligner trays are carefully seated by our clinical team. Mei Lin Zhou or Jonas Berg demonstrates proper insertion, removal, and cleaning techniques, ensuring you feel confident managing your appliances at home.',
	'hc_s2_2' => 'We also provide initial care supplies and explain what slight pressure to expect during the first few days. Before you leave the chair, your first review appointment is booked on the clinic screen, maintaining our unbroken scheduling chain from day one.',
	'hc_s2_h' => 'What occurs at your first fitting appointment?',
	'hc_s3_1' => 'During active treatment, you return every six to eight weeks for focused twenty-minute review appointments. Our orthodontic therapists evaluate movement progress against your initial computer model, verify appliance fit, and inspect gum health. If minor deviations occur, Dr. Varga or Dr.',
	'hc_s3_2' => 'Mensah refines the plan, ordering supplemental aligner sets or modifying archwires as necessary. Refinements are entirely included within your original course fee, preventing unforeseen expenses. Typical courses run twelve to eighteen months for adult aligners or eighteen to twenty-four months for fixed braces. When tooth movement finishes, we manufacture your custom retainers and schedule your review visits for three, six, and twelve months ahead.',
