	'm_label' => 'How a course is planned',
	'm_s01' => 'Records',
	'm_s01_t' => 'During your forty-five-minute records appointment, Aiyana Brooks captures comprehensive diagnostic data in our imaging suite. We take precision 3D digital scans of your teeth, two digital X-rays, and detailed photographs. This complete anatomical picture allows Dr. Varga and Dr. Mensah to evaluate your bite accurately without uncomfortable impression trays.',
	'm_s02' => 'Plan',
	'm_s02_t' => 'Every treatment plan is reviewed collaboratively by both Dr. Varga and Dr. Kwame Mensah during our Tuesday clinical planning meeting. In your forty-minute plan conversation, we present a clear written document showing the projected tooth movements, your appliance options, expected treatment length, and exact cost. You take this complete plan home with zero obligation to proceed.',
	'm_s03' => 'Review visits',
	'm_s03_t' => 'Once your custom aligners or fixed braces are prepared, your sixty-minute first fitting begins your course. We place your appliances, explain daily care, and book your first routine review visit before you leave. From that point on, twenty-minute visits every six to eight weeks ensure steady progress according to the plan.',
