	'nl_label' => 'Four letters a year',
	'nl_lead' => 'Letters from the chair is our quarterly clinic newsletter, published four times a year. We share practical orthodontic notes, seasonal dates, and appliance care guidance.',
	'nl_s1_1' => 'Letters from the chair is distributed four times annually, arriving in March, June, September, and December. Each edition is brief, focused, and free from promotional advertisements. Inside, we publish upcoming Saturday review clinic dates so working patients and parents can plan their schedules well in advance. We also include practical guidance on aligner maintenance and retainer hygiene, helping you keep appliances clean and clear.',
	'nl_s1_2' => 'Finally, each issue features one short clinical note written by Dr. Ilse Varga or Dr. Kwame Mensah reflecting on orthodontic observations from our chairs. Nothing else is included.',
	'nl_s1_h' => 'What is published in our quarterly letters?',
