	'nl_s2_2' => 'We never share, rent, or transfer contact details to third parties, and we will never send unsolicited marketing messages or commercial offers. If you ever wish to stop receiving our quarterly mailings, an unsubscribe link is included in the footer of every letter, allowing you to remove your address immediately with a single click.',
