	'pn_s1_1' => 'Lena started treatment at age fifteen to address severe dental crowding. She was concerned about wearing visible metal appliances at school, so Dr. Varga suggested ceramic fixed braces. Her active treatment lasted twenty-two months, with review visits scheduled every six to eight weeks on Tuesday late afternoons.',
	'pn_s1_2' => 'In Lena\'s own words: "I thought I\'d hate the visits. They were twenty minutes and I always knew what was next." Her appointments focused on gentle wire changes and tracking arch development. Since completing treatment, Lena wears clear upper and lower retainers every night, attending her post-course reviews at three, six, and twelve months without complications.',
	'pn_s1_h' => 'Lena, 15: Fixed ceramic braces over twenty-two months',
	'pn_s2_1' => 'Tomás, a self-employed carpenter in Wrenfield, sought treatment at thirty-four to correct overlapping lower front teeth and bite misalignment. Because of his busy workshop schedule, he needed predictable appointments that would not interrupt his working day. He completed a fourteen-month course of clear aligners comprising twenty-eight aligner sets and nine twenty-minute review visits. Two of his reviews took place on Saturday mornings.',
	'pn_s2_2' => 'At month nine, Dr. Mensah ordered a brief refinement series after checking progress on screen. Tomás kept his aligners in their case during dusty carpentry work and wore them twenty-two hours daily, finishing his course exactly as planned before starting retention.',
	'pn_s2_h' => 'Tomás, 34: Clear aligners over fourteen months',
	'pn_s3_1' => 'Mariam contacted our clinic at age fifty-two after noticing that teeth treated in her youth had gradually relapsed out of line. She met with Nadia Haddad and Dr. Varga to discuss whether adult orthodontic treatment remained feasible decades later. Dr.',
	'pn_s3_2' => 'Varga designed a focused nine-month clear aligner course to guide her front teeth back into alignment. Her review appointments were conducted every seven weeks by Mei Lin Zhou, fitting neatly into Mariam\'s weekday schedule. After nine months of consistent tray wear, Mariam completed active movement and transitioned directly into custom retainers, attending regular checks at three, six, and twelve months.',
	'pn_s3_h' => 'Mariam, 52: Relapse correction with clear aligners over nine months',
	'pv_h1' => 'Privacy',
	'pv_label' => 'Privacy',
	'pv_lead' => 'What we keep when you write to us, book a visit or ask for the letters, and why.',
	'pv_s1' => 'When you ask for a first visit, we keep your name, a phone number or email address and the times you suggest, so that Sofia Marchetti can reply and book you in. When you become a patient, your clinical records are kept by the clinic for as long as the law requires and are seen only by the people who treat you.',
	'pv_s1_h' => 'What we keep',
	'pv_s2' => 'If you ask for the letters, we use your email address for those four letters a year and nothing else. Writing to us from this page opens your own email app; nothing is sent until you press send there, and you are not on the list until we have replied.',
	'pv_s2_h' => 'Letters from the chair',
	'pv_s3' => 'You can ask us at any time what we hold about you, to correct it, or to remove you from the letters. Write to hello@soroeclinic.example or phone +00 20 555 0190 during opening hours. We do not sell your details and we do not share them for advertising.',
	'pv_s3_h' => 'Your choices',
	'qa_a1' => 'Orthodontic tooth movement works at any age, provided your teeth and gums are healthy. Many of our adult patients are in their thirties, forties, or fifties.',
	'qa_a2' => 'Routine review visits take twenty minutes and occur every six to eight weeks. We schedule each appointment before you leave the chair so your calendar stays predictable.',
	'qa_a3' => 'Modern aligners and gentle archwires apply light, controlled pressure. You may feel mild tenderness for two or three days following adjustments, but it quickly subsides.',
	'qa_a4' => 'We provide one clear, all-inclusive price before treatment begins. Review visits and emergency appointments are always included, with monthly instalment options over your treatment length at no extra charge.',
	'qa_q1' => 'Am I too old?',
	'qa_q2' => 'How often will I need to come?',
	'qa_q3' => 'Will it hurt?',
	'qa_q4' => 'What will it cost, really?',
	'r_c1' => 'Fit',
	'r_c1_t' => 'We verify that your aligner trays or orthodontic brackets are seating fully and comfortably without unexpected friction.',
	'r_c2' => 'Movement against the plan',
	'r_c2_t' => 'We compare your current tooth alignment against your original 3D digital simulation to confirm steady progress.',
	'r_c3' => 'Gums and cleaning',
	'r_c3_t' => 'We assess your periodontal health and oral hygiene, ensuring your gums remain healthy around appliances.',
	'r_c4' => 'The next set',
	'r_c4_t' => 'We provide your next series of aligners or make delicate wire adjustments, booking your next visit before you leave.',
	'r_cta' => 'Review visits',
	'r_h' => 'What a review visit is for',
	'r_intro' => 'Routine review visits are focused, twenty-minute appointments every six to eight weeks. Rather than keeping you waiting, we check four precise elements of your treatment to ensure your teeth are tracking exactly as planned.',
	'r_label' => 'Twenty minutes, every 6–8 weeks',
	'rv_band_h' => 'Every review visit looks at the same four things',
	'rv_band_label' => 'Four checks',
	'rv_h1' => 'Review visits',
	'rv_label' => 'Review visits',
	'rv_lead' => 'Review visits at Soroe Clinic are designed to be brief, predictable, and thorough. Every appointment takes twenty minutes, allowing you to return promptly to school or work.',
	'rv_more' => 'Read the notice',
	'rv_s1_1' => 'Review visits occur every six to eight weeks and last exactly twenty minutes. When you sit in one of our four treatment chairs, our clinical team focuses on four precise checks. First, we examine the physical fit of your aligner trays or brackets. Second, we assess tooth movement against your digital treatment plan.',
	'rv_s1_2' => 'Third, we inspect gum condition and plaque levels to maintain optimal oral health. Fourth, we prepare your next step, either dispensing your upcoming aligner sets or making wire adjustments. Before you stand up from the chair, Sofia Marchetti books your next review appointment, confirming the exact date, time, and clinical tasks.',
	'rv_s1_h' => 'What happens during your twenty-minute review visit?',
	'rv_s2_1' => 'We recognize that balancing school, university, and full-time employment can make daytime appointments difficult. To assist our patients, Soroe Clinic stays open until nineteen-thirty on Tuesday evenings, providing convenient after-school appointment slots for teenagers. Furthermore, we open our clinic on Saturdays between nine in the morning and one in the afternoon specifically for review visits.',
	'rv_s2_2' => 'These Saturday morning sessions carry no supplementary fees and are strictly reserved for routine twenty-minute checks, ensuring parents and working adults can maintain their regular appointment cycle without missing school lessons or weekday work obligations. We announce upcoming Saturday scheduling dates quarterly in our clinic letters.',
	'rv_s2_h' => 'Can review visits be scheduled on Saturdays or evenings?',
	'rv_s3_1' => 'When attending a clear aligner review visit, please bring your current tray set, your previous set, and your aligner carrying case. For patients with fixed braces, simply brush your teeth thoroughly before arriving. If an unexpected conflict arises and you must miss a review appointment, please phone our reception desk at +00 20 555 0190 as early as possible.',
	'rv_s3_2' => 'Because our review visits are booked in concise twenty-minute intervals, Sofia Marchetti can usually reschedule you within a few days. Prompt rescheduling ensures your teeth continue moving on schedule and prevents unnecessary delays in completing your overall course.',
	'rv_s3_h' => 'What should you bring and what happens if you miss an appointment?',
	'rv_sat_label' => 'Saturday review visits',
	's_eyebrow' => 'Search',
