	'tm_cap1' => 'Dr. Kwame Mensah, orthodontist',
	'tm_cap2' => 'Nadia Haddad, treatment coordinator',
	'tm_cta' => 'Meet the team',
	'tm_h' => 'Who you\'ll see',
	'tm_h1' => 'Team',
	'tm_label' => 'Seven people',
	'tm_lead' => 'Our seven-member clinical and support team works closely together to ensure your orthodontic treatment is organized, gentle, and unhurried at every visit.',
	'tm_n1' => 'Dr. Ilse Varga',
	'tm_n2' => 'Dr. Kwame Mensah',
	'tm_n3' => 'Nadia Haddad',
	'tm_n4' => 'Mei Lin Zhou',
	'tm_n5' => 'Jonas Berg',
	'tm_n6' => 'Aiyana Brooks',
	'tm_n7' => 'Sofia Marchetti',
	'tm_p' => 'Soroe Clinic is staffed by a dedicated team of seven professionals who work together on every patient course. Both Dr. Varga and Dr. Mensah review every treatment plan during our clinical planning meeting. You will see the same orthodontic therapist for most of your review visits, and Sofia books your next appointment before you leave the clinic.',
	'tm_p1' => 'Dr. Ilse Varga',
	'tm_p2' => 'Dr. Kwame Mensah',
	'tm_p3' => 'Nadia Haddad',
	'tm_p4' => 'Mei Lin Zhou',
	'tm_p5' => 'Jonas Berg',
	'tm_p6' => 'Aiyana Brooks',
	'tm_p7' => 'Sofia Marchetti',
	'tm_r1' => 'Orthodontist, Founder',
	'tm_r2' => 'Orthodontist',
	'tm_r3' => 'Treatment Coordinator',
	'tm_r4' => 'Orthodontic Therapist',
	'tm_r5' => 'Orthodontic Therapist',
	'tm_r6' => 'Records and Imaging',
	'tm_r7' => 'Reception and Scheduling',
	'tm_roster_h' => 'Who you will see',
	'tm_roster_label' => 'Seven people',
	'tm_s1_1' => 'Dr. Ilse Varga founded Soroe Clinic in 2011 to provide dedicated orthodontic care for teenagers and adults. With years of clinical experience, she guides the practice\'s treatment standards and clinical philosophy. Working alongside her is Dr.',
	'tm_s1_2' => 'Kwame Mensah, a specialist orthodontist who brings extensive experience in complex tooth movement, adolescent growth, and adult clear aligner mechanics. Both orthodontists examine all diagnostic records together during our daily one-thirty planning meeting. This collaborative review ensures every patient benefits from two specialist perspectives on tooth movement, appliance selection, and retention strategy before any active appliance is fitted.',
	'tm_s1_h' => 'Our orthodontists and clinical directors',
	'tm_s2_1' => 'Our clinical appointments are supported by skilled orthodontic therapists Mei Lin Zhou and Jonas Berg. Mei Lin and Jonas carry out routine twenty-minute review visits in our four treatment chairs, performing delicate wire adjustments, placing aligner attachments, and monitoring tissue health under orthodontic supervision. Aiyana Brooks leads our records and imaging suite, capturing detailed intraoral 3D scans, diagnostic photographs, and low-dose digital X-rays with calm precision.',
	'tm_s2_2' => 'By ensuring imaging is comfortable and efficient, Aiyana produces the exact digital models Dr. Varga and Dr. Mensah require to construct your written treatment plan.',
	'tm_s2_h' => 'Our orthodontic therapists and records specialist',
	'tm_s3_1' => 'Nadia Haddad serves as our treatment coordinator, meeting patients in our private conversation room for free first visits and plan presentations. Nadia explains treatment steps, reviews fee options, and answers day-to-day questions about life with braces or aligners. At reception, Sofia Marchetti oversees scheduling and patient communication.',
	'tm_s3_2' => 'Sofia ensures every appointment runs on time, coordinating school-friendly Tuesday evenings and Saturday morning visits. True to our founding principle that every visit plans the next, Sofia confirms and books your upcoming review appointment before you leave our clinic reception counter.',
	'tm_s3_h' => 'Treatment coordination and scheduling',
	'tr_band_h' => 'Planned one visit at a time',
	'tr_band_label' => 'Four courses',
	'tr_h1' => 'Treatments',
	'tr_label' => 'What we treat',
	'tr_lead' => 'We provide focused orthodontic treatment for teenagers and adults using fixed braces and clear aligners. Every course is planned individually to suit your daily life and dental needs.',
	'tr_s1_1' => 'Fixed braces remain an effective approach for teenage patients, correcting crowding, spacing, and bite alignment with precision. We offer contemporary fixed braces that typically require courses lasting eighteen to twenty-four months. Review appointments take place every six to eight weeks, each lasting twenty minutes to check tooth movement, adjust wires, and monitor oral hygiene.',
	'tr_s1_2' => 'Tuesday evenings are reserved until seven-thirty to accommodate school commitments easily. Full teenage courses start from €3,600, which includes all scheduled review visits and any emergency visits that might be needed during treatment. Fees can be spread across monthly instalments over the course length at no extra charge.',
	'tr_s1_h' => 'Fixed braces for teenagers',
	'tr_s2_1' => 'Adult orthodontic care can begin at any age, whether addressing longstanding alignment issues or bite changes that have developed over time. For adults seeking fixed appliances, we use ceramic brackets that blend subtly with natural tooth enamel. Adult courses with ceramic fixed braces typically last eighteen to twenty-four months, requiring twenty-minute review visits every six to eight weeks. We evaluate periodontal health carefully before placing appliances and coordinate smoothly with your general dentist.',
	'tr_s2_2' => 'Fixed ceramic braces for adults start from €4,400. This fee covers the full course, all planned adjustments, and emergency visits. Treatment costs can be divided into equal monthly instalments across the active treatment period.',
	'tr_s2_h' => 'Ceramic fixed braces for adults',
	'tr_s3_1' => 'Clear aligners offer a removable, transparent alternative for straightening teeth comfortably. Adult courses typically span twelve to eighteen months, utilizing a progressive sequence of custom-manufactured trays worn twenty-two hours each day. You attend review appointments every six to eight weeks for twenty minutes, where our clinicians check tray tracking against your digital plan before dispensing your next sets.',
	'tr_s3_2' => 'Clear aligner courses start from €4,200. This single comprehensive fee includes all initial aligner sets, clinical refinements, and scheduled review appointments. As with all courses at Soroe Clinic, payment can be divided into predictable monthly instalments over the treatment duration without additional interest or financing charges.',
	'tr_s3_h' => 'Clear aligners for adults and teenagers',
	'tr_s4_1' => 'Retainers safeguard your teeth once active movement concludes, holding them firmly in their corrected positions while surrounding bone stabilizes. Every completed course transitions into a structured retention phase. Retainers and first-year checks cost €380, covering precision upper and lower retainers alongside clinical checks at three, six, and twelve months post-treatment.',
	'tr_s4_2' => 'During these appointments, our team inspects appliance fit, monitors dental stability, and reviews wear routines. Should you ever require a replacement retainer after your initial twelve months of supervised maintenance, replacement retainers cost €140 each. Consistent retainer wear ensures the results achieved during your orthodontic course remain stable for years to come.',
	'tr_s4_h' => 'Retainers and first-year maintenance',
	'w_cta' => 'Read what the first visit is',
	'w_ghost' => 'Worries',
	'w_h' => 'Most people wait|years before asking.',
	'w_label' => 'What people tell us first',
	'w_p1' => 'Many adults arrive having spent ten or twenty years thinking about their teeth. They were told at fourteen that their bite might settle, or that treatment could wait, and life took over. Teenagers walk in worried about conspicuous metal brackets, uncomfortable school days, and long appointments that disrupt their routines. Most people hesitate simply because they assume orthodontic care will be complicated or intrusive.',
	'w_p2' => 'When patients sit down in our conversation room, the questions are remarkably consistent. They want to know how long treatment really takes, how often they will need to come in, what the total fees will be, whether adjustments hurt, and whether treatment is worthwhile for minor crowding. People want clear, practical facts before they commit to anything.',
	'w_p3' => 'Our approach begins with a free thirty-minute conversation. We take photographs, examine your teeth, and listen carefully to your concerns, with no X-rays and no pressure to make a decision on the day. If you choose to proceed, we create a thorough written plan that you take home to review in your own time.',
);
